WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand beside a wall and place the palm and forearm on it at shoulder height.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Step the same-side foot forward slightly.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Gently turn the chest away from the wall.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the shoulder blade sliding down.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
